#, python-format
msgid ""
"The new price covers a past period. %(count)s usage entry was priced "
"between %(start)s and %(end)s and keeps its old cost until you recompute "
"it. Each entry is priced again with the price valid at its own time."
msgid_plural ""
"The new price covers a past period. %(count)s usage entries were priced "
"between %(start)s and %(end)s and keep their old costs until you "
"recompute them. Each entry is priced again with the price valid at its "
"own time."
