msgstr "Campos calculados"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:891
msgid ""
"Fields whose value is fixed by the project. Each one is filled in "
"automatically on every issue here, is never stored on the issue itself, "
"and cannot be overridden by a client — so it can never drift, and it "
"recomputes when an issue moves to another project."
