"In the project on GitLab, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add new "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"En el proyecto de GitLab, abre Settings, luego Webhooks y luego Add new "
"webhook."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1394
